# instructed-route B2 P3, the SER MLP replication (plans/B2-plan.md section 3; spec.md R3). U bound, one model
# load. Per run and task: D, H and F, each an item-swap interchange at all positions of the six one-member MLP
# groups in p3_groups.json (mlp.11, 13, 16 under test; mlp.30, 31; mlp.0 positive control), --knockout-singles
# off, --include-ids of the run's tracked id file with --n-causal 1000. seed0 is the reproduction of the
# mechanism-analysis selection sample (SER only); seed1 is the held-out sample (run A), seed2 the CPU draw that
# excludes seeds 0 and 1 (run B). FAR and SDR cells are descriptive (R3). D, H and F share the cell name
# U__leaf/<task>_v2, so each (seed, role) has its own --output-dir; the reader layout is B2-p3-layout.json.
# Written by B2 ticket T8 (hand-back reports/19-handback.md).
# Run from the worktree root:
#   sbatch --time=00:30:00 --partition=P --account=A scripts/analyze_components.sbatch batch \
#       docs/research/instructed-route/jobs/B2-p3.batch --timings outputs/_analyses/instructed-route-b2/timings/p3.json
# Login check: python analyze_components.py batch docs/research/instructed-route/jobs/B2-p3.batch --dry-run

